id: pm-context-b7ub
title: Release workflow publishes npm before advancing protected main (GH006 desync)
description: "Daily Release published pm-context@2026.8.9 to npm and then its direct HEAD:main push was rejected by protected-branch policy (GH006), leaving npm at 2026.8.9 while git main stays at 2026.8.7 with no tag. Replace the direct push with a release-branch pull-request transaction that merges validated metadata before any irreversible npm publication, mirroring pm-changelog's release.yml."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 0
tags[5]: branch-protection,github-actions,production-readiness,release,transaction-safety
created_at: "2026-08-09T12:47:22.193Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-09T13:53:19.423Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-09T13:14:54.590Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-09T13:14:54.590Z"
claim_principal: pi-agent
author: pi-agent
acceptance_criteria: "Workflow requests pull-requests:write and never directly pushes HEAD:main; release metadata is pushed to a deterministic branch and merged via a PR before npm publish; merged main is verified at the intended npm version; tag is created on the merged commit only after publish succeeds; retry paths reuse an existing PR/version and skip already-published npm versions; workflow syntax and the full release gate pass."
risk: critical
resolution: "Protected-branch-compatible release PR transaction ported from pm-changelog (pmc-84ow): pull-requests:write added, Merge-through-PR + Verify-merged steps inserted before Publish, Push release tag is tag-only. main now advances before npm publish."
expected_result: git main contains the release commit before npm publish runs; a rejected push can no longer desync npm from git.
actual_result: "Workflow reordered and validated locally; base_sha added to Decide; Verify step diffs package.json package-lock.json manifest.json index.ts dist CHANGELOG.md. release:check exit 0."
notes[2]:
  - created_at: "2026-08-09T13:14:13.130Z"
    author: pi-agent
    text: "Diagnosis: .github/workflows/release.yml ran 'Publish npm package' (line ~149) BEFORE 'Push release tag and main' (git push origin HEAD:main). On 2026-08-09 ~04:40 UTC the daily release published pm-context@2026.8.9 to npm, then the direct HEAD:main push was rejected by protected-branch policy (GH006), leaving npm at 2026.8.9 while git main stayed at 2026.8.7 with no v2026.08.09 tag. Because npm is immutable, any push failure permanently desyncs npm from git."
    edited_at: "2026-08-09T13:53:19.423Z"
  - created_at: "2026-08-09T13:14:13.685Z"
    author: pi-agent
    text: "Fix (ported from pm-changelog release.yml / pmc-84ow): added pull-requests:write; added base_sha output to 'Decide release'; inserted 'Merge release metadata through protected PR' (pushes release/<ver>, opens/reuses a PR, merges via API with merge_method=rebase and sha=<release_commit> pinned) and 'Verify merged release' (refetches origin/main, asserts merged SHA + package version, re-runs release:check, diffs package.json package-lock.json manifest.json index.ts dist CHANGELOG.md); replaced 'Push release tag and main' with a tag-only 'Push release tag'. Invariant now enforced: git main contains the release commit BEFORE npm publish runs."
files[1]{path,scope,note}:
  .github/workflows/release.yml,project,Reordered to merge-through-PR + verify + tag-only push
tests[1]{command,scope,note}:
  "npm run release:check",project,Full repo release gate (typecheck/build/coverage/audit/pack) green
docs[1]{path,scope,note}:
  "https://github.com/unbraind/pm-changelog/blob/main/.agents/pm/issues/pmc-84ow.toon",global,Reference implementation this fix is ported from
close_reason: "Release workflow now merges release metadata through a protected-branch PR and verifies merged main BEFORE publishing to npm; the direct HEAD:main push is removed and replaced by a tag-only push. YAML is valid and the full release gate (typecheck/build/coverage/audit/pack) is green."
body: ""
